<DTA TYPE="STRING">[_____] <MET>kPa</MET><ENG>psig</ENG>.  Install back pressure regulating valve on the pump discharge and factory adjust to crack open at [_____] <MET>kPa</MET><ENG>psig</ENG>.  Regulators must be of [polyvinyl chloride][ or ][_____] construction with [fluorocarbon resin][ or ][chlorosulphonated polyethylene] diaphragms.</DTA>
